> destroy my robe setting off a random poly trap.

Searching intrinsic helps to locate the traps and dig around the traps
if necessary.

Make your armor fire resistant against fire traps (and magic traps).[*]

Traps of polymorph, teleport, level teleport, energy drain, and magic
traps won't work if you have a source of MR (gray dragon scales, or a
cloak of MR over your silver scales).

> And, most importantly, how do I keep all my armor from being destroyed
> by those damn traps that are everwhere?

[*] Reading a scroll of enchant armor while confused will make a random
piece of worn armor rust/fire/rotproof and restores it to its undamaged
state. Reading a cursed scroll of destroy armor while confused will make
a random piece of worn armor rust/fire/rotproof _if_ it wasn't already
damaged.

And, BTW, if you care for your armor, avoid disenchanters.

